{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# V3 — Section 3: Production Run\n`Gro_Simulations.py` · `Oniom_Generation.py` · `Shell_Oniom.f90` · `Gaussian_Calculations.py`","x":-220,"y":-1160,"width":440,"height":140,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"inputs","type":"text","text":"### Inputs\n- `nvt_vacuum2.gro` — equilibrated solute (from Section 2)\n- `{Topology_File}` — user-supplied topology (includes resolved by `expand_topology_with_itps`)\n- `minim.mdp`, `nvt.mdp`, `npt.mdp`, `template_2.mdp`\n- `Settings.yml`: density, mol_mass, L, Configurations, Cut_Off_Radius, qr1/2/3, replicas, T, P\n- `Shell_Oniom.f90`\n\n⚠️ WIP: `system_title` not defined in `Run_SCEE.py`","x":-220,"y":-1000,"width":440,"height":400,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"mol_count","type":"text","text":"### Molecule Count\n`N = (density × (L×1e-7)³ / mol_mass) × 6.022e23`\n`initial_molecules = ceil(N + 0.05N) − 1`","x":-220,"y":-580,"width":440,"height":160,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"concat_top","type":"text","text":"### `Oniom_Generation.expand_topology_with_itps(Topology_File)`\nRecursively resolves all `#include` statements → single concatenated string saved as `Concat_Top.top`.\n\nSpecial handling: skips `forcefield.itp` body but includes `ffnonbonded.itp` within it (needed for `[atomtypes]` σ/ε values). `seen` set prevents circular includes.","x":-220,"y":-380,"width":440,"height":280,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"concat_top_note","type":"text","text":"**V2 → V3:** Entirely new. V2 required separate `{central}_AA.itp`, `{solvent}_UA.itp`, and `oplsaaff.itp` files to be provided explicitly. V3 resolves the full topology in memory from a single `.top` file.\n\n⚠️ WIP bug: inner `walk` function incorrectly takes `self` as first argument.","x":320,"y":-540,"width":320,"height":300,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"run_md2","type":"text","text":"### `Gro_Simulations.run_md2(Topology_File, Mixture='No', MD='Box')`\n1. `minim.mdp` → EM → `em1.gro`\n2. `nvt.mdp` → NVT equil → `nvt_eq.gro`\n3. `npt.mdp` → NPT equil → `system.gro`\n\n**Always called regardless of mode** — even if user provides a pre-built box.","x":-220,"y":-40,"width":440,"height":240,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"run_md2_note","type":"text","text":"**V2 → V3:** Output renamed from `{system_title}.gro` to `system.gro`. Intentionally always runs: user-provided boxes may not be well-equilibrated. `_wait_for_md_slot()` removed.","x":320,"y":-160,"width":320,"height":180,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"oniom_gen","type":"text","text":"### `Oniom_Generation` — writes `oniom.inp`\n`Gen_File(Oniom, Configurations, solvent, Cut_Off_Radius)` — header block\n`QM_Inputs(Topology, Oniom, qr1, qr2, qr3)` — reads charges from `[atoms]`, LJ from `[atomtypes]` in `Concat_Top.top`. Uses `Atoms.Atom_Types()`. Returns `(Total_Atoms, qmax)`.\n`MM_Inputs(Topology, Oniom, qr1, qr2, qr3)` — second `[atoms]` block for solvent\n`Counting_Molecules(Oniom, initial_molecules)`\n\n⚠️ `get_atomtypes` now handles both 7- and 8-column formats.","x":-220,"y":240,"width":440,"height":360,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"oniom_gen_note","type":"text","text":"**V2 → V3:** No longer needs separate `.itp` files or `oplsaaff.itp`. Charges read directly from `[atoms]` (not via force field lookup). `Gen_File` second arg changed from `system_title` to `solvent` (Shell_Oniom output file stem). `get_atomtypes` extended to handle 8-column format.","x":320,"y":80,"width":320,"height":220,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"run_md3","type":"text","text":"### `Gro_Simulations.run_md3(mdpfile, HOMEDIR, system_title, T, P, ...)` (per replica/T/P)\n1. Fill `template_2.mdp` (TEMPERATURE, PRESSURE) → mdp file\n2. `gromacs.grompp` + `gromacs.mdrun` → `{system_title}_QMMM_md3.xtc/.edr/.gro`\n3. Calls `process_trajectory(system_title)` internally\n4. Calls `process_gro()` internally (compiles + runs Shell_Oniom)\n\nReads starting structure from `HOMEDIR/system.gro`.\n\n⚠️ WIP bug: `process_gro(Mixture)` called but `process_gro` takes no args.","x":-220,"y":650,"width":440,"height":450,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"run_md3_note","type":"text","text":"**V2 → V3:** `process_trajectory` and `process_gro` now called internally within `run_md3` rather than as separate explicit calls from `Run_SCEE.py`. `process_gro` now copies `oniom.inp`, `shellO`, and `Shell_Oniom.f90` to replica dir before running.","x":340,"y":360,"width":320,"height":220,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"shell","type":"text","text":"### `Shell_Oniom.f90` — unchanged from V2\n`gfortran -o shellO Shell_Oniom.f90 && ./shellO`\n\nFor each `conf_N.gro`:\n1. Read `oniom.inp` — control params, solute/solvent atom blocks\n2. Apply PBC, centre on solute central atom\n3. nm → Å (×10), σ × 0.561231, ε ÷ 4.184\n4. Select solvent molecules within Rcut1\n5. Even/odd correction — remove furthest mol if count is even\n6. Write 6 files per config:\n   - `{solvent}_cN_q1/2/3.inp` — ONIOM geometry (H+L layers)\n   - `{solvent}_cN_q1/2/3_chg.inp` — point charge coords only","x":-220,"y":1210,"width":440,"height":530,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"init4","type":"text","text":"### `Gaussian_Calculations.init4(Gaus='SCEE_V1')` — single-point + SCEE fitting\nExtracts QM geometry from Z-matrix in V0 `.out` files.\n`Atoms.Atom_Symbol(atomic_number)` → element symbol\n\nComputes charge scaling internally:\n`Model_Dipole = Analysis.get_dipole_model_liquid()`\n`ratio = Model_Dipole / qmax`\n`num1/2/3 = qr1/2/3 × ratio × qmax`\n\nRoute: `{method}/{basis} charge`\nPoint charges from `_chg.inp`\n`get_multipole_statistics()` → `dipole_l/m/h` per config\n\n⚠️ WIP: `system_title`, `qmax`, `qr1/2/3` not passed as args — expected in calling scope.","x":80,"y":1860,"width":420,"height":560,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"init4_note","type":"text","text":"**V2 → V3:** Charge scaling calculation (`ratio`, `num1/2/3`) moved from `Run_SCEE.py` into `init4`. Creates internal dependency on `get_dipole_model_liquid()` being callable from within `Gaussian_Calculations`.","x":620,"y":1960,"width":320,"height":220,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"outputs","type":"text","text":"### Outputs\n- `em1.gro`, `nvt_eq.gro`, `system.gro` — box equilibration structures\n- `Concat_Top.top` — resolved topology\n- `{system_title}_QMMM_md3.xtc/.edr/.gro` — production trajectory\n- `conf_0.gro` ... `conf_N.gro` — extracted frames\n- `oniom.inp` — Shell_Oniom config\n- `{solvent}_cN_q1/2/3.inp`, `_chg.inp` — per-config ONIOM inputs\n- `SCEE/` — Gaussian V0 and V1 `.dat` / `.out` files\n- `Dipole_SCEE.csv` — `dipole_l`, `dipole_m`, `dipole_h` per config","x":-240,"y":2560,"width":440,"height":400,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"init3","type":"text","text":"### `Gaussian_Calculations.init3(Gaus='SCEE_V0')` — ONIOM optimisation\nRoute: `oniom(B3LYP/6-31+G(d,p):amber=(print,SoftFirst,LastEquiv))=embedcharge`\nOptions: `opt=quadmacro iop(1/98=66,1/19=7)`\nCharge/spin: `0 1 0 1 0 1`\n\nOne `.dat` per `{solvent}_cN_q?.inp`. Writes to `SCEE/`.\nBash throttle → `g09`","x":-520,"y":2000,"width":400,"height":320,"color":"6"}
	],
